From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiny <owner@shinychang.net>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:27:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: preview Lottie JSON and .lottie files in the browser

- lottie_preview: a component extension in resources.pak that plays Lottie
  JSON and .lottie files with dotlottie-web 0.80.0 (vendored, MIT): play and
  pause, frame scrubbing, speed, loop, background, the themes and animations
  of a .lottie, a Raw JSON toggle, Open and Save.
- A .lottie over http(s) is redirected by a dynamic declarativeNetRequest
  rule, because static rulesets are read from disk and a component extension
  in the pak has none; a local .lottie arrives as a download and is reopened
  in the viewer.
- Give the extension file access (component loader flag and
  util::AllowFileAccess; InitializeFileSchemeAccessForExtension now honours
  AllowFileAccess) so file:// JSON and .lottie files open too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
